<statement>
<p>
	You should use the &lt;pf&gt;readlines&lt;/pf&gt; command to import the words from these text files: wordle_dictionary.txt some_wordle_words.txt
</p>

<tabular valign="top" top="minor">
	<col width="12%"/>
	<col width="88%"/>
	<row bottom="minor">
		<cell>Inputs:</cell>
		<cell>
			<p><pf>no</pf> number — function inputs</p>
		</cell>
	</row>
	<row bottom="minor">
		<cell>Outputs:</cell>
		<cell>
			<p><pf>dictionary_words</pf> (14854 1) number — array of strings.</p>
			<p><pf>wordle_words</pf> (200 1) number — array of strings.</p>
		</cell>
	</row>
</tabular>

<p>
	Examples:
<program>
	<code>
		you should be able to run the function by typing the following in the command window:
		[dictionary_words, wordle_words] = HW6_get_word_lists_Key()
	</code>
</program>
</p>
</statement>
